<title>USA: Public Service Enterprise grows in Thailand.</title>
<headline>Public Service Enterprise grows in Thailand.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public Service Enterprise Group, said Monday, that its subsidiary, CEA Thailand Power Ltd has bought 49.9 percent of Thailand based Energy and Infrastructure Development Co Ltd, a privately held energy provider based in Bangkok.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
